	(descr "Bare THT solder field, 8 positions, 2x4 @ 4.20mm pitch / 5.5mm row -- the §2.8 v1.4.0 PCIe 8-pin output-daughterboard OUTPUT field (per cable, shared by the 2-port and 3-port SKUs). Standard PCIe CEM motherboard-side map: 1-3=+12V, 4-6=GND (power-class, 1.8mm/2.7x3.7mm oval), 7=SENSE1, 8=SENSE0 (18AWG-class, 1.4mm/2.6mm round -- tied to GND on the daughterboard's own copper, no dedicated blade tab). Pad grid measured off the vendored Molex Mini-Fit Jr 5569-08A2 land. No connector body/shroud.")
